# omid.dev

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root for build commands, layout, and workflow. Read `PRODUCT.md` for purpose, audience, brand/tone, surfaces, and ship-bar intent.

This is a Hugo static site (`hugo.yaml`, theme `themes/omid-dev`). Search uses Pagefind (post-build via `npx`).

- Keep changes minimal and focused.
- Do not commit `public/`, `resources/`, `static/pagefind/`, `.tmp/`, or secrets.
- Only create git commits when the user explicitly asks.
- Run `hugo --minify` after template or config changes; fix build errors before finishing. For search changes, also run `./scripts/pagefind-index.sh`.
- The owner serves locally with `./scripts/hugo-server-dev.sh` (`.tmp/hugo-server`, port 1314). Agents must not use that script; verify with default `hugo server` / `hugo --minify` (`public/`, port 1313) so sessions do not conflict. Do not delete `.tmp/` when cleaning.
